# Accessibility

- WCAG contrast on all text — especially over glass/blur surfaces.
- Touch targets ≥ 48dp; spacing for one-handed use.
- Test matrix: 100%, 130%, 200% font scale; TalkBack; Reduce Motion.
- Never rely on color alone for state.
- `contentDescription` and custom semantics for non-text controls.
- Emergency flows: highest clarity, no motion-only cues.
- Reference: `docs/design/ACCESSIBILITY_VISUAL_RULES.md`.
